# Handbook of high-frequency trading and modeling in finance

**Authors:** I. Florescu, G. Stanley, F. Viens, M. Mariani

## Abstract
Reflecting the fast pace and ever-evolving nature of the field, Handbook of HighFrequency Trading and Modeling in Finance will present the latest research on the topic, utilizing a new, more applications-driven approach that focuses on trading activities in today's market scenarios. The result will be an essential reference for professionals in the fields of business, econometrics, and financial engineering.

